					"documentation" : "@dev Creates a vesting contract that vests its balance of FlameToken token to the\r\n _multiSigAddress, tokens are released in an linear fashion after a moth \r\n has passed until _start +  nrOfMonths * months. \r\n By then all of the balance will have vested.\r\n @param _cap total amount of tokens to be minted 50-50\r\n @param _months vesting period in months\r\n @param _multiSigAddress address of multisig account (the holder of tokens)\r",
